Case report
Stiff person syndrome associated with lower motor neuron disease and
inﬁltration of cytotoxic T cells in the spinal cord
Trygve Holmøya,b,∗, Gjertrud Skorstada, Line Sveberg Røstec, David Scheied, Kirsti Alvikc
